        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All new Game Mode in which you have to defend the holy giant puffball against waves of fungal forces! Completely new skill tree, enemies and more achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This update also includes Cloud Sync and Full Steam Deck and Controller Support.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749430/extras/4965243f982eb44311bd42c2ded5e4b4.avif?t=1771753698\" width=335 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect different kinds of Mushrooms all based on real-life Mushrooms you may find in the wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749430/extras/989dfb3619d4107a713cbedfd9c166b2.webp?t=1771753698\" width=335 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749430/extras/65a7c1fe6ff8f7c296d100b98fdeb65c.avif?t=1771753698\" width=68 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are the newest Mushroom Wizard Initiate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hand in your Mushrooms to Archmage Psilocybe to earn XP and level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749430/extras/70e6a554c160b60a0cd31e56b4194707.avif?t=1771753698\" width=335 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can hire little creatures of the forest to harvest your Mushrooms for you, so you don't have to do anything except sit back, relax, and watch that number go up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749430/extras/6b941de9545d2bd80e1b5ee902307779.avif?t=1771753698\" width=500 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you level up, spend your skill points on lots of different skills and spells to customize your playthrough, find crazy synergies and make that number go up even faster!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749430/extras/4965243f982eb44311bd42c2ded5e4b4.avif?t=1771753698\" width=335 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect different kinds of Mushrooms all based on real-life Mushrooms you may find in the wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749430/extras/989dfb3619d4107a713cbedfd9c166b2.webp?t=1771753698\" width=335 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749430/extras/65a7c1fe6ff8f7c296d100b98fdeb65c.avif?t=1771753698\" width=68 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are the newest Mushroom Wizard Initiate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hand in your Mushrooms to Archmage Psilocybe to earn XP and level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749430/extras/70e6a554c160b60a0cd31e56b4194707.avif?t=1771753698\" width=335 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can hire little creatures of the forest to harvest your Mushrooms for you, so you don't have to do anything except sit back, relax, and watch that number go up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749430/extras/6b941de9545d2bd80e1b5ee902307779.avif?t=1771753698\" width=500 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you level up, spend your skill points on lots of different skills and spells to customize your playthrough, find crazy synergies and make that number go up even faster!</p>",
        "short_description": "An Idle Incremental Clicker game with cosy magical vibes. You are the newest Mushroom Wizard Initiate 🧙‍♂️ Cast spells 🪄 harvest mushrooms 🍄 and level up to become more powerful! Hire little creatures 🐿️ to help you harvest and unlock different types of shrooms and skills!",
